  "headline": "Prabowo and Polri Dismantle International Drug Trafficking Rings",
  "seoTitle": "Mabes Polri and Prabowo Dismantle Drug Rings",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto and Mabes Polri oversee the destruction of 601.7 tons of narcotics as part of a national crackdown on organized drug crime.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto and National Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto presided over the destruction of 601.7 tons of seized narcotics.",
    "The National Police reported over 73,000 suspects arrested in connection with more than 56,000 narcotics cases throughout the past year.",
    "Police leadership pledged to dismiss any personnel involved in drug offenses and confirmed thousands of inmates have been moved to Nusakambangan."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government has intensified its efforts against narcotics trafficking, with President Prabowo Subianto tasking the National Police (Polri) to prioritize the eradication of drug networks, smuggling, and online gambling. During a recent operation, authorities destroyed 601.7 tons of illicit substances valued at approximately Rp61.68 trillion. National Police Chief Jenderal Suyudi Ario Seto characterized narcotics as a central criminal threat that facilitates other illegal activities, including money laundering and the trade of unauthorized weapons. As part of this comprehensive enforcement strategy, police have processed over 73,000 suspects in the last year, including 247 foreign nationals. Furthermore, the agency has transferred 3,526 convicted inmates to the high-security prison in Nusakambangan, Central Java, to mitigate internal drug operations within correctional facilities. Chief Seto also emphasized a zero-tolerance policy for police officers implicated in drug-related crimes.",
